aero engine digital twin

Requirements:
1. SDL3-devel-3.4.16-mingw.zip (https://libsdl.org/release/SDL3-devel-3.4.16-mingw.zip)
2. SDL3.dll 

Compile Instructions:
arch = `x86_64-w64-mingw32`
`gcc -o out.exe file.c -I_arch_/include -L_arch_/lib -lSDL3`
Copy SDL3.dll next compile binary
`cp _arch_/bin/SDL3.dll .`
`./out.exe`
